stream carries image bytes or a qualified absence/unsupported\n541:This does not require a semantic change to B0 through B5. B3 already makes\n557:require its own design and is outside B0 through B7.\n577:2. D2 lossless DAG: drop it from B0 through B7 and make it a non-goal. Named\n588:5. D5 hash identity: `:call-hash H` names the canonical executable image hash\n600:9. D9 H function: B1's single `image-hash` function hashes descriptor bytes\n623:No owner decision blocks B0. B0 starts with D1 and the frozen parity corpus.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
